id":"7jT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bf1336f3-53b2-48f8-b66a-43c78ceb2b49","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"がんばればポートできるのでやってどうぞ、ってことか","ts":"1630948639.225400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tqC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"43cd0193-2266-4dd6-88d7-ea1fbfe9923f","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"ではなかった","ts":"1630948630.225100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Yzb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5eac5a45-b51b-4736-98a3-b401123b60a9","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"Ren'Py は Pygame ベース?","ts":"1630948616.224800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3ieGl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"717a1d21-2f4f-4fc8-99df-f521cc261210","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"\u0026gt; Ren'Py games are not dependent on any other software on these platforms. There's no need for your users to download runtimes, drivers, codecs, or anything like that. If a user has one of the supported platforms, Ren'Py will run. (Even if not, Ren'Py is written using portable technologies like pygame, and so can probably be made to run.)","ts":"1630948607.224500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"n9zo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"849df1c4-a500-44b8-a848-49353523eeb0","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"ファイル名からかい","ts":"1630947080.224200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WxA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8a3e7be3-20a7-4ba2-8db5-bf9e74f9be33","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"\u0026gt; To do this we scanned through all the filenames of every game on Steam. We didn't have access to the actual file contents, mind you, so all we could do was make best guesses based on patterns in the filenames themselves. The project is ongoing: here's the Github repository with all the scripts and heuristics.","ts":"1630947078.224000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0L+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2cf765f7-d209-4ac9-a84d-493dbe3d5838","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"集計は一体どうやったんだろう","ts":"1630946897.223700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i38x"}]},{"client_msg_id":"125ae09c-237f-4197-88d9-a3af9b74b4c3","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"Steam でゲームエンジン登録する欄がみつからないけど","ts":"1630946894.223500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"z0O"}]}]
